+ * Gate: TRACE_ON(seh), the same gate the ntdll dumper uses, so WINEDEBUG=+seh turns
+ * both on. Measured caveat, because it cost a wasted run: WINEDEBUG=-all+seh produces
+ * ZERO lines from either dumper, while plain +seh produced 770. Only access violations
+ * are dumped, and at most forty per image, and faults at or above 0x60000000 are
+ * skipped: Mike raises 230 access violations in one run (90 at 7BCD2B60, Wine's own
+ * probes, 46 inside this translation layer, and 2 at the demo's crash site), so
+ * dumping everything would bury the one that matters.
+ *
