+ * of this engine family have already misled us once, so each register is dumped as a
+ * window around it (the member this engine dereferences is +0xc0, so the window covers
+ * -0x20 to +0x50), and the guest stack is dumped as raw words so that return addresses
+ * inside the demo's module range are matched against the binary offline.
